<br class="ltx_break">Second paragraph of description part is not clear; Use parameter <math id="S4.T3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> for temperature without note is weird.</span>
</span></td></tr>
